{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MolecularConstruction.H2oBondAngleShift","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MolecularConstruction.H2oBondAngleShift","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.bond_angle_shift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.bond_angle_shift","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-bond-angle-shift.lean#L28-L37","doc":"**Bent angle = quadratic-well minimum shifted by the lone-pair term.**\nThe harmonic bending energy `a(θ-θ₀)²` plus the linear lone-pair\nperturbation `(2as)·θ` is minimised at `θ₀ - s` (so `s = b/(2a)` for\n`b = 2as`). The energy minus its value at the minimiser is the perfect\nsquare `a(θ - (θ₀ - s))² ≥ 0`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:h2o-bond-angle-shift","label":"prop:h2o-bond-angle-shift","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-bond-angle-shift.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}